# save: blank
# boot: power
# Power-on to the title screen's letter reveal, START during it (RUN_TITLE_SEQUENCE: the
# title restarts in quick mode, FADE_IN(16,1)), START again on the finished title: its fade-out
# and SHOW_TITLE_SCREEN's own (already black: one @WAIT_VBLANK frame), into the file select
# overclock: max
# skip: 1
# skip: 2
# FILE_SELECT_INIT's FADE_IN(1,1) runs on NMIs during RUN_FILE_MENU's load lag in the original,
# so FILE_SELECT_MENU's @WAIT_FADE (a busy wait the emu counts as frames) ends 4 logic frames
# earlier; the port's last 4 wait frames have no counterpart
# extra: 2895 2896 2897 2898
---
2500 -
1 START
